    {
      "text": "Joseph Smith delivered up that which was sacred to wicked man, D&C 3:12. gift is sacred and comes from above, D&C 6:10. trifle not with sacred things, D&C 6:12. ancient records which have been hid up are sacred, D&C 8:11. cannot write that which is sacred unless it is given from the Lord, D&C 9:9. that which comes from above is sacred and must be spoken with care, D&C 63:64. governments must hold sacred freedom of conscience, D&C 134:5.",
